---
// The Formula — regenerative medicine as an abstract bond-line molecule that
// draws itself in hairlines on scroll ([data-draw] handled in motion.ts).
// Deliberately abstract: evocative, TGA-safe, claims nothing specific.
---

<section class="relative bg-surface text-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-16 px-6 py-28 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-40">
    <div>
      <p class="readout text-ink/45" data-reveal>03 — The formula</p>
      <h2 class="sweep mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-5xl" data-sweep>
        Engineered to regenerate.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65" data-reveal>
        Our biologics are built around a simple conviction: the body is the
        best surgeon. Integrant scaffolds and graft systems are designed to
        give biology the structure it needs to do the rest.
      </p>
      <p class="readout mt-10 text-[10px] text-ink/40" data-reveal>
        FrameIT · GraftIT · developed with surgeons
      </p>
    </div>

    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 480 400"
      class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      data-draw
      data-reveal
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <!-- bond-line hexagons -->
      <path d="M 210.6 175 L 210.6 245 L 150 280 L 89.4 245 L 89.4 175 L 150 140 Z" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-ink/60"></path>
      <path d="M 330.6 105 L 330.6 175 L 270 210 L 209.4 175 L 209.4 105 L 270 70 Z" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-ink/60"></path>
      <path d="M 330.6 245 L 330.6 315 L 270 350 L 209.4 315 L 209.4 245 L 270 210 Z" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-ink/35"></path>
      <!-- substituent bonds -->
      <path d="M 150 140 L 150 76" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-ink/60"></path>
      <path d="M 330.6 105 L 388 72" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-ink/60"></path>
      <!-- atoms -->
      <circle cx="150" cy="68" r="7" class="fill-ink/85" stroke="none"></circle>
      <circle cx="394" cy="68" r="7" class="fill-ink/85" stroke="none"></circle>
      <circle cx="209.4" cy="175" r="5" class="fill-ink/55" stroke="none"></circle>
      <circle cx="330.6" cy="245" r="5" class="fill-ink/55" stroke="none"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>
